{"id":"CVE-2023-46219","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"hackerone","published":"2023-12-12T01:38:41.376Z","updated":"2026-10-15T00:04:51.589Z","description":"When saving HSTS data to an excessively long file name, curl could end up\nremoving all contents, making subsequent requests using that file unaware of\nthe HSTS status they should otherwise use.","cwe":["CWE-311 CWE-311 Missing Encryption of Sensitive Data"],"metrics":[{"src":"CISA-ADP","v":"3.1","score":5.3,"sev":"MEDIUM","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:N"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"poc","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"curl","product":"curl","versions":["affected 8.4.0 <=8.4.0 (semver)","unaffected 7.84.0 <7.84.0 (semver)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.5 <* (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518F-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.5 <* (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIPLUS S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.5 <* (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SINEC NMS","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected 0 <V3.0 SP1 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://hackerone.com/reports/2236133"},{"url":"https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2023-46219.html"},{"url":"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/UOGXU25FMMT2X6UUITQ7EZZYMJ42YWWD/"},{"url":"https://www.debian.org/security/2023/dsa-5587"},{"url":"https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20240119-0007/"},{"url":"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/3ZX3VW67N4ACRAPMV2QS2LVYGD7H2MVE/"},{"url":"https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-093430.html"},{"url":"https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-331112.html"},{"url":"https://cert-portal.siemen